  {
   "id": 532808,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve for the angle measurements in the figure shown.<br>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/9f37bc6fd85a58fb.png\" alt=\"A horizontal line with a ray originating from its center. The line makes an acute angle, 2 x plus 5 with the ray, and an obtuse angle, 5 x with the ray.\">\n</figure>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Straight angles measure exactly 180°.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5x + 2x + 5 = 180\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"7x = 175\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x = 25^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2x + 5\"></span> = <span data-math=\"2\\left( {25} \\right) + 5 = 50 + 5 = 55^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5x = 5\\left( {25} \\right) = 125^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p>The angles measure 125° and 55°.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{5x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{{125^ \\circ }} \\\\ {2x + 5} &amp; { = } &amp; {{55^ \\circ }}\\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{rcl}{5x}&amp;{ =}&amp;{{125^ \\circ }}\\\\{2x + 5}&amp;{=}&amp;{{55^ \\circ }}\\end{array}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
